# label | keys | help key | on or off

always
  quit | ctrl+c | ^c | on
  help | ? | ? | off

Picker (types)
  up | up ctrl+p | ↑/^p | on
  down | down ctrl+n | ↓/^n | on
  page up | pgup | pgup | on
  page down | pgdown | pgdn | on
  open | enter | ↵ | on
  close | esc | esc | on
  scope | tab | tab | off
  previous scope | shift+tab | shift+tab | off
